<title>UK: UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT:2.5 BLN</p>
<p>COUPON:7.0 PCT</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2002</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: DEC 4</p>
<p>NOTES: Issue is strippable when strips facility is introduced. First interest payment on June 7 at rate of 3.5288 per 100 nominal of stock.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
